What this fork adds or changes:
- record: a person's own actions to JSON Lines (with drag paths, page addresses, field
  labels, window places), an MP4 video, record start/stop/status in the background, and an
  on-screen indicator with a Stop button, shown by default;
- stroke: replaying a drawn path;
- recorder fixes, display numbers in list-displays, a radio button's checked state;
- the recording-to-script and script-repair guides;
- packages/desktop-recorder-mcp: an installer for AI agents.

